# Pages your shine consumers actually ship, measured by verify/measure-consumers.mjs.
# Copy to consumers.pages.local (gitignored) and edit.
#
# Format: name|path-or-url
#
# A local file is measured directly. Use an http URL when the page loads
# root-absolute assets (/assets/tokens.css) — those do not resolve over file://,
# and measuring a page whose stylesheet never loaded tells you nothing about the
# design. Start your own server first.
#
# my-site|~/Projects/my-site/index.html
# my-app|http://127.0.0.1:3000/
